# Fault asif_scenario (writer 6): `ask q: r as if {scenario sc}` in the base was refused REFCORE-NOT-YET though sc is
# loaded. L §6.4 Asking: "Inside an expression, x as if {scenario s} is x in s"; L §8.2 `world:` lists "any as if
# {scenario s} it reached". In sc, r is replaced by 2 from 2026-06-01; the law date 2026-10-25 falls in it: q = 2, as
# q2 (a `with scenario sc` pin) is.
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-25
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "synthetic"

input r: int

ask q: r as if {scenario sc} law 2026-10-25

ask q2: r with scenario sc law 2026-10-25

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  r = 1
=== sc.tally
scenario sc over m
  tally 2
  from 2026-06-01

version w
  cite s
  governs 2026-06-01..
  known 2026-10-25
  replace r = 2
=== expect
q: 2
  world: sc
  law date 2026-10-25, cut 2026-10-25
q2: 2
  world: sc
  law date 2026-10-25, cut 2026-10-25
